sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as MongoDB
  participant P as Adaption

  B->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/google (credential)
  A->>A: Verify signature, issuer, audience, expiry
  A->>D: Find or create user by verified sub
  A-->>B: Application session cookie
  B->>A: Project requests with session cookie
  A->>D: Owner-scoped read/write
  B->>A: POST /api/v1/ai/blueprint (scene brief)
  A->>P: Server-side provider request
  P-->>A: Structured output
  A->>A: Schema validation
  A-->>B: Validated blueprint
  B->>B: Local Web Audio analysis
  B->>A: Numeric metrics only
  A->>P: Metrics + objective
  P-->>A: Qualified mix report
  A-->>B: Report with facts, hypotheses, limits
